      "description": "Copenhagen Denmark Art Deco Amusement Trade Token Tivoli Gardens ND\nBronze d. = 31 mm\nTivoli Gardens, also known simply as Tivoli, is an amusement park and pleasure garden in Copenhagen. The park opened in 1843 and is the third-oldest operating amusement park in the world.\nThere the Pantomime Theatre is an open-air theatre and noted for its mechanical front curtain that takes five men to operate and unfolds like a peacock's tail.\nCurved below 6 peacock feathers: \"TIVOLI\" / The same on the reverse. Numista N# 170357\n\nCondition:   VERY FINE",
